<description>Two toroidal KB mirrors on a common platform.

Two vertical actuators support the common platform. Equal travel lifts
both mirrors, and differential travel pitches the assembly. The VFM
attaches directly to the platform. An upright carries the HFM's two
sideways actuators, which adjust its translation and local pitch.
Positive local Y points toward the downstream support of each platform.

Run this script for a short actuator demonstration and focus readout.
Set SHOW_3D to True or pass --glow to adjust the stages in xrtGlow.</description>
